From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Orion Unofficial <orion-unofficial@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:20:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Support a paired FF-A 1.2 StandaloneMM image on CIX

Backport the StandaloneMM boot-information and HOB interface from upstream OP-TEE baf391d0726a0224c79a732502554dd5b92e1cbe, retaining the CIX legacy default and NOR/debug services. Correct the upstream free-memory-top calculation and reject invalid or overflowing HOB bounds. Serialize the CIX NVRAM GUID HOB explicitly from the existing flash parameters.

CFG_STMM_FFA_VERSION=12 is an experimental component build option requiring a matching modern MM core and CPU driver. Reject the two known legacy vendor images in that mode. Public firmware packaging continues to require its pinned vendor payload. Both configurations compile; mocked C tests cover bounds, serialization and memory-permission error paths. No modern hybrid image or hardware boot is claimed.
